# Lidia's Heart (Q023) at cond 4, through Innocentin's "Yes, I read it" link (31328-12):
# cond 4 jumps to 6 without cond 5, so QuestState.setCond sets the progression flags
# (bits 1-4 from cond 4, bit 6 for cond 6, the sign bit) and QuestList shows them.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (Q023_LidiasHeart.java,
# QuestState.setCond and calculateFlags).
character Lidia 64
quest Q022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest <state>=COMPLETED
quest Q023_LidiasHeart <cond>=4 <state>=STARTED
stub quest.Q022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest
